# Package only what the extension needs at runtime and what the stores display. vsce rewrites the
# README's relative image links to point at GitHub, so the images themselves stay out.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview.js
!dist/webview.css
!schemas/*.json
!assets/icon.png
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!ThirdPartyNotices.txt
